# Engine B display — PPM → show.json; live opens X11 via spark-engine-show.
# Dry:  ./spark --dry-run examples/browser_show.spark  (display:false)
# Live: ./spark --live examples/browser_show.spark
#       → ./spark-engine-show --ppm … --hold 2000 (needs DISPLAY)
# Pipeline PPM: examples/engine_pipeline.spark → out/engine/pipeline.ppm

browser show "examples/fixtures/browser/engine_show.ppm" -> show
